        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LGN01, Laguna 48 Inch Wood Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 48 Inch Laguna Wooden Door Handle has a 1.5 inch diameter wood grip.  The brackets are satin stainless steel. This Laguna Series 1.5 Wood Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LGN08 Laguna Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid White Oak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center 24\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood.pdf?v=1704262330\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
