                "description": "The 48 Inch Laguna Wooden Door Handle has a 1.5 inch diameter wood grip.  The brackets are satin stainless steel. This Laguna Series 1 Wood Door Handle can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted.",
